Terminals which are not used

   COMMA
   LPAREN
   RPAREN


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: stmt_list

    2 stmt_list: stmt stmt_list
    3          | /* empty */

    4 stmt: load_stmt
    5     | save_stmt
    6     | replace_stmt
    7     | print_stmt
    8     | delete_stmt
    9     | count_stmt
   10     | append_stmt
   11     | if_stmt
   12     | expr_stmt

   13 load_stmt: LOAD STRING opt_into_id

   14 save_stmt: SAVE STRING opt_into_id

   15 opt_into_id: INTO ID
   16            | /* empty */

   17 replace_stmt: REPLACE STRING TO STRING

   18 print_stmt: PRINT STRING
   19           | PRINT ID

   20 delete_stmt: DELETE FROM ID opt_where

   21 count_stmt: COUNT FROM ID opt_where

   22 append_stmt: APPEND STRING INTO ID

   23 opt_where: WHERE cond
   24          | /* empty */

   25 if_stmt: IF cond THEN stmt_list ENDIF

   26 expr_stmt: ID ASSIGN expr

   27 expr: term
   28     | expr PLUS term

   29 term: ID
   30     | NUMBER
   31     | STRING

   32 cond: ID WHEREOP STRING
   33     | ID EQ NUMBER
   34     | ID NEQ NUMBER

   35 WHEREOP: EQUALS
   36        | CONTAINS
   37        | STARTSWITH
   38        | ENDSWITH


